Author: Olof Johansson <olof@lixom.net>
Date:   Fri Sep 25 14:01:02 2026 -0700

    l1: tap F17's page only once it has rendered

    A web link is in the accessibility tree once parsed, before WebKit can
    hit-test it. After a warm launch the tap on "Open in Maps" landed about
    100 ms after commit and reached nothing: no click, no navigation, no
    prompt, so testATappedLinkToAnotherAppAsksFirst failed by test order,
    not by what the simulator has installed.

    The handoff page now reports rendered after load and two frames, and
    both F17 tap tests wait for it before tapping.

    Spec: docs/features/F17-hand-off-needs-a-tap.md

